 location="Runs upward and backward across the insula and around the frontal and anterior parietal opercula in the Sylvian fissure, emerging on the convexity as the orbitofrontal, prefrontal, precentral, central and anterior parietal arteries.",
 subdivisions=[("Orbitofrontal and prefrontal branches", "lateral prefrontal cortex and inferior frontal gyrus"), ("Precentral (pre-Rolandic) artery", "premotor cortex, frontal eye field, Broca's area"), ("Central (Rolandic) artery", "face and arm areas of the precentral and postcentral gyri"), ("Anterior parietal artery", "anterior supramarginal region")],
 function="Perfuses the frontal and anterior parietal convexity: motor and sensory cortex for the face, hand and arm, the frontal eye field, the premotor cortex and, on the dominant side, Broca's area.",
